o-transparent border border-amber-500/20 animate-float\"><div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-4xl opacity-30\">☯</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold bg-amber-700 text-white rounded\">C</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">极简宣纸 · 清新风格</span></div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\">浅色宣纸纹理 + 居中布局 + 圆角标签</span></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-sm\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-parchment-100 via-white to-parchment-50 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=&#x27;100&#x27; height=&#x27;100&#x27; viewBox=&#x27;0 0 100 100&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3E%3Cfilter id=&#x27;noise&#x27;%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=&#x27;fractalNoise&#x27; baseFrequency=&#x27;0.8&#x27; numOctaves=&#x27;4&#x27; stitchTiles=&#x27;stitch&#x27;/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=&#x27;100&#x27; height=&#x27;100&#x27; filter=&#x27;url(%23noise)&#x27; opacity=&#x27;0.5&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;)\"></div><div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-radial from-amber-100/40 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-gradient-radial from-amber-100/30 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 relative z-10 text-center\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><span class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/50 rounded-full bg-amber-50/50\">传承千年 · 玄学智慧</span></div><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800 tracking-wide\">命理网</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 mb-4 font-kai tracking-widest\">传承千年智慧 · 解读命运密码</p><p class=\"text-gray-500 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed\">融合四柱八字、紫微斗数、奇门遁甲、梅花易数四大传统命理体系</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><a class=\"px-10 py-4 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-gray-900/20\" href=\"/bazi\">开始排盘</a><a class=\"px-10 py-4 border border-gray-300 text-gray-700 rounded-full font-medium hover:border-gray-400 hover:bg-white/50 transition-all\" href=\"/membership\">开通会员</a></div><div class=\"mt-20 flex items-center justify-center gap-6\"><div class=\"h-px w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-amber-300/50 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"flex gap-8\"><span class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm tracking-widest\">八字</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm tracking-widest\">紫微</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm tracking-widest\">奇门</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm tracking-widest\">梅花</span></div><div class=\"h-px w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-amber-300/50 to-transparent\"></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><footer class=\"border-t border-gray-200 bg-white py-8 mt-12\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-sm\"><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">A · 经典墨金（当前版本）</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-500\"><li>• 暗红渐变背景 + 金色渐变文字</li><li>• 四列圆角卡片 + hover 渐变</li><li>• 中式印章装饰元素</li><li>• 波浪 SVG 过渡效果</li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">B · 暗黑高奢（现代风格）</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-500\"><li>• 深色渐变背景 + 粒子纹理</li><li>• 毛玻璃效果 + 渐变边框</li><li>• 八卦太极装饰动画</li><li>• 左右分栏大标题布局</li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\">C · 极简宣纸（清新风格）</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-500\"><li>• 宣纸纹理浅色背景</li><li>• 白色卡片 + 轻量边框</li><li>• 圆角标签装饰</li><li>• 居中极简布局</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-8 text-xs text-gray-400\">此页面为设计对比 Demo，不影响线上版本。各变体可自由组合使用。</div></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if(\"/$\"===d||\"/&\"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else\"$\"!==d&&\"$?\"!==d&&\"$~\"!==d&&\"$!\"!==d&&\"&\"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data=\"$\";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};\n$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data=\"$~\",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&(\"number\"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC(\"B:0\",\"S:0\")</script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[11761,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n3:I[95545,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"Header\\\"]\\n4:I[4707,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"ErrorBoundary\\\"]\\n5:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[52619,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"8974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-6b2d65511ceaf73c.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[97923,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"Footer\\\"]\\n9:I[81959,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\na:I[91134,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\